OL,3,GNEWSATeen pleads guilty over Channel
OL,4,Aboat with 165 migrants
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who piloted a dinghy
OL,7,Fcarrying a then-record 165 migrants
OL,8,Facross the English Channel to the UK
OL,9,Fhas pleaded guilty to endangering
OL,10,Fothers during a sea crossing.
OL,12,FChan Mathok Atak, 19, originally from
OL,13,FSouth Sudan, admitted the offence at
OL,14,FCanterbury Crown Court in relation to a
OL,15,Fcrossing on 23 July.
OL,17,FRescuers said they were astonished and
OL,18,Falarmed to see the number of people
OL,19,Fpacked onto the dinghy.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
